  "validationNotes": {
    "scope": "Three complete originals, all eight original/reprint images checked across the research group; seven exact prints belong to this batch. Generic two-color-slot discard alternative reserves distinct cards before payment, evaluates effective hand colors, preserves zone permissions and commits unreplaceable replacement discards. Dragon destruction-discard protection accepts any Dragon-race face including spells. Existing saved IDs and formats preserved; no full test suite or known long group.",
    "resolvedAttempts": "Initial focused run exposed a real second replacement of Carol in the engine addZone path; replacement discards now bypass both Carol and grave-shuffle replacement and native replacement offers. Joe Star fixture was corrected to enter its actual D2 field so the engine civilization timestamp is active; hand costs use zoneCard, never mana-only civilization grants. An incorrect Urus fixture was replaced by actual Bolshack Dragon. All final 46 dedicated tests pass. The intermediate failed focused-final log was overwritten by the final successful rerun; its failure summary is preserved here, and the first failing focused run log is retained."
  },
